title: Marriage & God’s View of Divorce
description: A young adult Sunday school lesson on God’s design for marriage, divorce in Malachi, the Sermon on the Mount and Matthew 19, adultery under the Law, and the marriage supper of the Lamb.
output: lessons/genesis/genesis-2-marriage-and-divorce.html

# Converted from the old one-page lesson, card for card, in the author's order. The old Genesis 3 page is a separate deck.
# Genesis 2 design of marriage is covered by the separate genesis-2-marriage deck; the two are not merged.

